Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:51:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 96/97] temp/libfprint: report finger-needed for the sensor
 light

fprintd publishes the finger status as finger-needed/finger-present. The
goodixoplus driver now reports FP_FINGER_STATUS_NEEDED while it waits for a
finger, so that goodix-fp-overlay can light the sensor under a compositor,
and waits 150 ms for the light before the capture.
---
